※ pl4g-test: compile=error
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 7012 LANG_MACRO_NO_RULE

※ A rule matches a shape, and how many arguments were written is part of the shape.
※ Where no rule matches there is nothing to replace the invocation with: a macro
※ meant to accept anything ends with a rule whose pattern is holes.

macro pair:
    ⌜$x, $y⌝ → ⌜$x⌝

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    ⎕narrow(pair⌜1u8⌝, ⌜u6⌝) ?? 1u6
